  check_arm tm true false rules iarm0_0_0RB0LD_1RC0LA_1LD1RB____1LA
            ch_iarm0_0_0RB0LD_1RC0LA_1LD1RB____1LA = true.
Proof. vm_compute. reflexivity. Qed.

